n subtyping and coercion with it, then coercion without (`Functionals.scala:703-716`; row 508 closed), and a result-only parameter takes its bounds under the expected type, never `BottomType` (row 447 closed; "The compiled checker instantiates a type parameter that nothing at a call fixes ..." below).+}
